Vitest already has globalSetup and globalTeardown config options designed for this. Define a global setup file (vitest.setup.ts):

export async function setup() {
  setActivePinia(createPinia())
  await initialiseStateInPiniaOnceForAllTests()
}

Then in vitest.config.ts:

test: {
  globalSetup: ['./vitest.setup.ts']
}

All test files can then access the shared Pinia state. If this doesn't persist state between files or throws 'setActivePinia not set', let us know the specific error for proper debugging.
